Failed devin relaunch, 2026-09-19 15:42 UTC: the replacement devin never wrote its
SessionStart sidecar inside fm-spawn devin_wait_for_session bound (60 polls x 0.5s = 30s),
so the gate failed and rovo_endpoint_cleanup killed the tmux window the relaunch had adopted.

